  "solution": "Logic :** (1st number × 3rd number) ÷ 4 = 2nd number**\n\nGiven : \n\n__\n \n• (22, 44, 8)\n\n**(22 × 8)**__ ÷ 4 = 44\n\n__**176 **____**÷ 4**__ = 44\n\n44 = 44 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (32, 48, 6)​\n\n**(32 × 6)**__ ÷ 4 = 48\n\n__**192 ÷ 4**__ = 48\n\n48 = 48 (LHS = RHS)\n\n​So,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (36, 64, 7)​\n\n**(36 × 7)**__ ÷ 4 = 64\n\n__**252 ÷ 4**__ = 64\n\n63 ≠ 64 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (42, 63, 6)​\n\n**(42 × 6)**__ ÷ 4 = 63\n\n__**252 ÷ 4**__ = 63\n\n63 = 63 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : (56, 128, 9)​\n\n**(56 × 9)**__ ÷ 4 = 128\n\n__**504 ÷ 4**__ = 128\n\n126 ≠ 128 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (48, 98, 8)​\n\n**(48 × 8)**__ ÷ 4 = 98\n\n__**384 ÷ 4**__ = 98\n\n96 ≠ 98 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.\n\na0:T1c52,",
